  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.24 House of Representatives Plate",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.24 House of Representatives Plate.\n\n(a) House of representatives plates shall be issued to members of the New Hampshire house of representatives, pursuant to RSA 261:90.\n\n(b) In addition to the requirements set forth in RSA 261:90, house of representatives plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the words \"N.H. HOUSE\" on the upper border;\n\n(2) Have the years of term on the lower border;\n\n(3) Have numerals designating the registrant's house seat; and\n\n(4) Have the state seal.\n\n(c) At the request of the speaker of the house, the director shall issue special number plates with title designations.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 514.22); renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.23); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.24)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
